# Git Workflow

- Always work on `main`. Never create feature branches.
- Never run `git checkout -b`, `git switch -c`, or similar.
- Never create, update, or draft pull requests unless the user explicitly asks.
- Commit directly on `main`. Push to `origin main` only when the user asks to push.
- Do not use PR management tools unless explicitly requested.
